{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QdDAfPPeEWFk47PerSgPHB","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"CoRL 2023 reviewer guidelines scoring rubric overall recommendation scale\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2023 Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2023-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"ACL 2023 Acceptance Recommendations - ACL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://2023.aclweb.org/blog/overall-recommendation/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2023 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2023-paper-list/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews\"},{\"title\":\"ICLR 2023 Reviewer Guide\",\"url\":\"https://iclr.cc/Conferences/2023/ReviewerGuide\"},{\"title\":\"Development and Validation of a Scoring Rubric for Editorial Evaluation of Peer-review Quality: A Pilot Study\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC11000557/\"}]\n\nI found the CoRL 2023 Reviewer Guidelines page in the search results, but the excerpt provided doesn't contain the specific scoring rubric or overall recommendation scale details. The first search result is from the official CoRL 2023 reviewer guidelines, but it only shows guidance about limitations and reviewer conduct standards rather than the scoring scale itself.\n\nBased on what's available in the search results, I can see that CoRL papers are required to include a limitations section, and reviewers should treat honestly reported limitations kindly while unreported shortcomings should be strongly reflected in scores.\n\nHowever, the search results don't contain the specific scoring rubric or overall recommendation scale for CoRL 2023. To get the complete scoring rubric and recommendation scale information, you would need to visit the full CoRL 2023 reviewer guidelines page directly at https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fc4ce46a-8c3b-459f-bd12-119e3d710a0a","uuid":"4ce91f5c-5441-4a80-bab9-d0a8c0726662","timestamp":"2026-05-27T03:25:18.649Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"CoRL 2023 reviewer guidelines scoring rubric overall recommendation scale","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_012YHjah3D7FNbbDAx9VT3to","content":[{"title":"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023","url":"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines"},{"title":"CoRL 2023 Statistics - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2023-statistics/"},{"title":"ACL 2023 Acceptance Recommendations - ACL 2023","url":"https://2023.aclweb.org/blog/overall-recommendation/"},{"title":"CoRL 2023 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2023-paper-list/"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews","url":"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews"},{"title":"ICLR 2023 Reviewer Guide","url":"https://iclr.cc/Conferences/2023/ReviewerGuide"},{"title":"Development and Validation of a Scoring Rubric for Editorial Evaluation of Peer-review Quality: A Pilot Study","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC11000557/"}]},"I found the CoRL 2023 Reviewer Guidelines page in the search results, but the excerpt provided doesn't contain the specific scoring rubric or overall recommendation scale details. The first search result is from the official CoRL 2023 reviewer guidelines, but it only shows guidance about limitations and reviewer conduct standards rather than the scoring scale itself.\n\nBased on what's available in the search results, I can see that CoRL papers are required to include a limitations section, and reviewers should treat honestly reported limitations kindly while unreported shortcomings should be strongly reflected in scores.\n\nHowever, the search results don't contain the specific scoring rubric or overall recommendation scale for CoRL 2023. To get the complete scoring rubric and recommendation scale information, you would need to visit the full CoRL 2023 reviewer guidelines page directly at https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines."],"durationSeconds":4.734828020000001}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011gjvzYLixLd5pXyADPWooR","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"CoRL 2024 \"instruction for reviews\" reviewer scoring scale accept reject\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews\"},{\"title\":\"ICLR 2024 Reviewer Guide\",\"url\":\"https://iclr.cc/Conferences/2024/ReviewerGuide\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Authors\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-authors\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines\"},{\"title\":\"ICML 2024 Reviewer Instructions\",\"url\":\"https://icml.cc/Conferences/2024/ReviewerInstructions\"},{\"title\":\"The AI Review Lottery: Widespread AI-Assisted Peer Reviews Boost Paper   Scores and Acceptance Rates\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2405.02150\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found the CoRL 2024 Instructions for Reviews page. However, the search results do not contain the specific reviewer scoring scale details with numeric ratings for accept/reject recommendations from that page. \n\nThe search retrieved the CoRL 2024 Instruction for Reviews page, but it appears the full content with the scoring scale was not fully captured in the results. Submissions are evaluated based on the significance and novelty of results, either theoretical or empirical, judged on their objective establishment and/or potential for scientific and technological impact, as well as their relevance to robotic learning.\n\nThe results also show that authors of regular paper submissions have an opportunity to submit a response to reviewers and update papers during the rebuttal period.\n\nTo see the complete reviewer scoring scale for CoRL 2024, you may want to visit the full Instruction for Reviews page directly at: https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fc4ce46a-8c3b-459f-bd12-119e3d710a0a","uuid":"14c8e889-8c13-46fc-a033-8c102943ea85","timestamp":"2026-05-27T03:25:18.995Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"CoRL 2024 \"instruction for reviews\" reviewer scoring scale accept reject","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01CcrYqhJ2dUB5G3xuKYQWN5","content":[{"title":"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews","url":"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews"},{"title":"ICLR 2024 Reviewer Guide","url":"https://iclr.cc/Conferences/2024/ReviewerGuide"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Authors","url":"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-authors"},{"title":"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023","url":"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines"},{"title":"ICML 2024 Reviewer Instructions","url":"https://icml.cc/Conferences/2024/ReviewerInstructions"},{"title":"The AI Review Lottery: Widespread AI-Assisted Peer Reviews Boost Paper   Scores and Acceptance Rates","url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2405.02150"}]},"Based on the search results, I found the CoRL 2024 Instructions for Reviews page. However, the search results do not contain the specific reviewer scoring scale details with numeric ratings for accept/reject recommendations from that page. \n\nThe search retrieved the CoRL 2024 Instruction for Reviews page, but it appears the full content with the scoring scale was not fully captured in the results. Submissions are evaluated based on the significance and novelty of results, either theoretical or empirical, judged on their objective establishment and/or potential for scientific and technological impact, as well as their relevance to robotic learning.\n\nThe results also show that authors of regular paper submissions have an opportunity to submit a response to reviewers and update papers during the rebuttal period.\n\nTo see the complete reviewer scoring scale for CoRL 2024, you may want to visit the full Instruction for Reviews page directly at: https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews"],"durationSeconds":5.085320827000003}}
